WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.259 --> 00:00:02.419
(drums)

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.245
- I'm Zach Miko and I am the first

00:00:06.252 --> 00:00:08.305
Brawn model for IMG models.

00:00:08.305 --> 00:00:10.418
Yeah, I was big all growing up.

00:00:10.418 --> 00:00:13.261
I actually still have nightmares

00:00:13.261 --> 00:00:15.680
about being dragged to the husky section

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:17.102
when I was a kid.

00:00:17.102 --> 00:00:19.600
I don't know why but for all big guys

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.018
that's a word that will mean

00:00:22.018 --> 00:00:23.643
something different for
the rest of our lives.

00:00:23.643 --> 00:00:26.752
When I was growing up I
felt like I didn't belong

00:00:26.752 --> 00:00:28.053
because of my size.

00:00:28.053 --> 00:00:29.760
And I learned to compensate in other ways.

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:32.462
I tried to funny, I
learned to play guitar.

00:00:32.462 --> 00:00:35.103
You kinda find other reasons
for people to like you

00:00:35.103 --> 00:00:36.789
other than the way you look.

00:00:36.789 --> 00:00:40.691
I'm an actor and one day my acting manager

00:00:40.691 --> 00:00:42.376
was talking to a friend who was actually

00:00:42.376 --> 00:00:44.206
a makeup artist who worked at a studio

00:00:44.206 --> 00:00:46.075
and they said they were looking

00:00:46.075 --> 00:00:48.288
for a plus size guy and
they couldn't find one.

00:00:48.288 --> 00:00:50.809
I got a text message
from my manager saying

00:00:50.809 --> 00:00:52.190
how big is your waist?

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:54.507
And I was like why would
you wanna know that?

00:00:54.507 --> 00:00:55.745
(laughs)

00:00:55.745 --> 00:00:57.249
And then I told her

00:00:57.249 --> 00:00:59.383
and then I was in there

00:00:59.383 --> 00:01:00.581
for a test shoot an hour later.

00:01:00.581 --> 00:01:01.761
And then later that
week I had my first gig.

00:01:01.761 --> 00:01:02.613
And it was fun.

00:01:02.613 --> 00:01:03.345
It was great.

00:01:03.345 --> 00:01:04.117
I enjoyed it.

00:01:04.117 --> 00:01:06.087
I got a lot of press for being

00:01:06.087 --> 00:01:07.591
on the Target website.

00:01:07.591 --> 00:01:10.171
It was the first time my
body type had been shown.

00:01:10.171 --> 00:01:13.910
Not just by them but by
a mainstream retailer.

00:01:13.910 --> 00:01:15.413
So a lot of people got very excited

00:01:15.413 --> 00:01:16.307
and started talking.

00:01:16.307 --> 00:01:18.664
And I was very lucky that I've embarked.

00:01:18.664 --> 00:01:22.057
IMG models actually found me on Instagram

00:01:22.057 --> 00:01:24.334
and sent me a message.

00:01:24.334 --> 00:01:25.999
A couple days later I was in the office

00:01:25.999 --> 00:01:28.457
with not just Ivan but the head

00:01:28.457 --> 00:01:30.793
of the men's and woman's fashion board

00:01:30.793 --> 00:01:33.373
and different managers and PR.

00:01:33.373 --> 00:01:35.467
And I was like this is incredible.

00:01:35.467 --> 00:01:36.666
I guess this is for real.

00:01:36.666 --> 00:01:38.839
And I still was very overwhelmed by it

00:01:38.839 --> 00:01:42.049
until Ivan started
talking about diversity,

00:01:42.049 --> 00:01:44.000
and inclusion, and evolution,

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.662
and his dreams for not only for IMG models

00:01:46.662 --> 00:01:47.929
but for the whole fashion world.

00:01:47.929 --> 00:01:49.635
It hit me right in the heart and I knew

00:01:49.635 --> 00:01:51.261
that it wasn't fake.

00:01:51.261 --> 00:01:55.060
This was a real movement
that we're trying to do

00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:56.422
in the fashion world.

00:01:56.422 --> 00:02:00.018
Brawn is the new distinction
for big and tall men.

00:02:00.018 --> 00:02:03.004
It's all about taking the positive aspects

00:02:03.004 --> 00:02:07.069
of what being big and tall
is and highlighting that.

00:02:07.069 --> 00:02:09.385
The same that the women's
division is Curve.

00:02:09.385 --> 00:02:10.949
Before this you kinda find pieces

00:02:10.949 --> 00:02:14.037
that you really like and
then you wear them a lot

00:02:14.037 --> 00:02:15.784
because you know they fit.

00:02:15.784 --> 00:02:17.856
You see your typical male models

00:02:17.856 --> 00:02:20.072
and everybody has a washboard stomach

00:02:20.072 --> 00:02:21.554
and a perfect V shape.

00:02:21.554 --> 00:02:23.423
You grew up thinking
that was the only thing

00:02:23.423 --> 00:02:24.764
that it actually can be.

00:02:24.764 --> 00:02:29.764
And I learned to love myself
and my body through modeling.

00:02:30.068 --> 00:02:33.217
And I'm really hoping to
do the same for others.

00:02:33.217 --> 00:02:35.329
I think my main message as a model

00:02:35.329 --> 00:02:38.560
is that if I can get even a couple people

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:40.552
to feel good about the way they look,

00:02:40.552 --> 00:02:43.356
not what they think other
people want them to be,

00:02:43.356 --> 00:02:46.627
but how you look right now is beautiful,

00:02:46.627 --> 00:02:50.364
is attractive, and is valid.

00:02:50.364 --> 00:02:53.766
Cause I know that's a feeling
I didn't have for a long time.

00:02:53.766 --> 00:02:56.536
(guitar music)

00:02:58.962 --> 00:03:00.715
(static)

